string info = string.Format(
    "Hypotenuse: {0}",
    Math.Sqrt(width * width + height * height));
● Format specifiers:
string message = $"{name} is {age:f1} years old";

Raw string literals
● In C#, you can combine JSON with string interpolation ( $"...") to build 
JSON strings dynamically.
string name = "Alice";
int age = 30;
string json = $@"{{
  ""name"": ""{name}"",
  ""age"": {age}
}}";
Console.WriteLine(json);

